迈克:没什么,埃迪.算了吧,放松点.
Mike: Nothing, Eddie.Come on, relax.

134
00:07:49,600 --> 00:07:52,220
埃迪:好吧,那么今晚谁跟我去食杂店.
Eddie: All right.So, who's up for going to the grocery store tonight?

135
00:07:52,640 --> 00:07:53,700
卢克:我们昨天刚去了.
Luke: We just went yesterday.

136
00:07:54,140 --> 00:07:55,080
埃迪:哦,
Eddie: Yeah, that's cute.

137
00:07:56,640 --> 00:07:59,700
你真伶俐.我说的是城里最热闹的"新舞"俱乐部.
I am talking about the hottest new dance club in town.

138
00:08:00,360 --> 00:08:02,100
游船上的一位女工查丽丝告诉我的.
Charese, one of the ladies from the ship, told me about it.

139
00:08:02,200 --> 00:08:02,940
迈克:食杂店?
Mike: The Grocery Store?

140
00:08:02,960 --> 00:08:06,120
埃迪:哦,是的,迈克.他们有你平衡饮食所需的所有东西.
Eddie: Oh, yeah.Mike, they've got everything you need for a balanced diet.

141
00:08:06,420 --> 00:08:10,920
那里有蛋白质金发女郎,碳水化合物黑肤女郎,
There's blonds for protein, they've got brunettes for carbohydrates,

142
00:08:12,440 --> 00:08:13,100
粗粮红发女郎.
redheads for roughage...

143
00:08:15,180 --> 00:08:17,760
迈克:哦,不,谢谢.不,算了吧,伙计们,我不去.
Mike: Uh, no thanks.Nah, forget it, guys, I'm beat.

144
00:08:18,040 --> 00:08:19,960
埃迪:不,不!
Eddie: No, no!You can't miss this.

145
00:08:20,140 --> 00:08:22,040
你不能不去.迈克,你需要知道口令才能进去.
Mike, you need to know a password to get in.

146
00:08:22,660 --> 00:08:25,200
卢克:嘿,我和你去,埃迪,帮你探探路子.
Luke: Hey, I'll come with you Eddie.Help you squeeze the produce.

147
00:08:25,300 --> 00:08:26,680
埃迪:哦,你好,小兄弟.
Eddie: Well, hello, fellow shopper.

148
00:08:27,520 --> 00:08:30,040
迈克:不,不,不,不,不,埃迪,你忘了,卢克是未成年人.
Mike: No, no, no, no, no.Eddie, you forgot, Luke is underage.

149
00:08:30,320 --> 00:08:32,860
埃迪:我们开始偷偷摸摸地进入这些地方的时候还没他大呢.
Eddie: Well, he's older than we were when we started sneaking into places.

150
00:08:33,380 --> 00:08:36,240
我们只要先从假身份证里找到跟卢克长的像的就行.
We'll just have to dip into the secret stash of fake ID's here.

151
00:08:36,280 --> 00:08:37,620
迈克:埃迪,埃迪!
Mike: Eddie!Eddie!

152
00:08:37,620 --> 00:08:37,700
埃迪:这都是大师的杰作.
Eddie: Behold the work of the master.

153
00:08:40,180 --> 00:08:46,700
卢克:哇!这都是你用的?嘿,约翰尼威尔斯,
Luke: Whoa!You used these?Hey!Johnny Weis, James Marshall, Charlene Woo?

154
00:08:49,620 --> 00:08:50,980
詹姆斯马歇尔,沙林武?看啊,迈克,以前你怎么没让我们看这些东西呢?
C'mon, Mike, how come you never showed me these before?

155
00:08:51,000 --> 00:08:52,660
迈克:哦,因为我不再做这些事了.
Mike: Well, because I don't do that stuff anymore.

156
00:08:53,240 --> 00:08:55,220
卢克:嘿,嘿!
Luke: Hey, hey!This one looks just like me; blond, 5 foot 8.

157
00:08:57,160 --> 00:08:58,960
这个跟我长的很像:金发,5英尺8英寸.今晚我只要长一撮胡子就齐了.
All I have to do is grow a moustache by tonight.

158
00:09:01,180 --> 00:09:04,660
埃迪:哦,迈克,老实告诉你吧,
Eddie: Oh, Mike, I'm telling you man.This Grocery Store is something else.

159
00:09:05,140 --> 00:09:06,600
这个食杂店与众不同.不抓紧时间玩玩,警察说不准就查封了.
We've just gotta get there kinda quick before the vice squad shuts them down.

160
00:09:06,600 --> 00:09:08,000
迈克:埃迪,听我说,算了.
Mike: Eddie, listen to me.Come on.

161
00:09:10,640 --> 00:09:11,280
卢克有家庭作业,今天晚上我哪儿都不想去.
Luke has got homework,

162
00:09:11,380 --> 00:09:13,880
省得被人用催泪瓦斯打倒,
and I don't feel like going to some place tonight where I could get maced

163
00:09:13,880 --> 00:09:14,400
戴上手铐,扔上警车.
and handcuffed to some squad car.

164
00:09:14,400 --> 00:09:17,900
埃迪:好迈克,在今夜的值班员身上试试这个去?
Eddie: Nice Mike, try this on the duty tonight?

165
00:09:17,900 --> 00:09:22,700
迈克:你能不能说点儿别的?我和卢克对这不感兴趣.尤其是卢克.
Mike: Will you just drop this whole thing?Luke and I aren't interested.Especially Luke

166
00:09:25,000 --> 00:09:26,800
埃迪:好吧.
Eddie: All right, we could do something else.

167
00:09:28,160 --> 00:09:30,760
那就干点儿别的.嘿,
Hey, what do you say we go down to the Burger Barn and hassle some high

168
00:09:30,760 --> 00:09:31,200
你们觉得咱们到小卖店去逗逗高中生怎么样?
school kids?

169
00:09:33,060 --> 00:09:38,800
克莉丝:嗨,开萝尔,克里斯蒂娜·林恩·西沃在这里.星期五,放了学,妈妈嗲我去看<美女和野兽>.
Chrissy: Hi, Carol.Christina Lynn Seaver here.Friday after school, mommy took me to see "Beauty and the Beast."  It stars a beautiful girl named Belle, and a big, hairy beast...

170
00:09:38,800 --> 00:09:43,500
主人公是个漂亮的女孩,名叫贝勒和一只巨大的长毛野兽.
It stars a beautiful girl named Belle, and a big, hairy beast...

171
00:09:43,500 --> 00:09:56,100
本:(扮作野兽)(吼叫)
Ben (dressed as beast): (growling)

172
00:09:56,100 --> 00:09:57,800
本:你这是干什么?
Ben: What did you do that for?

173
00:10:00,020 --> 00:10:01,140
克莉丝:你吓着我了.另外,
Chrissy: You scared me.

174
00:10:01,140 --> 00:10:04,920
该我跟开萝尔讲话,你却把这搞砸了.
Besides, it's my turn to talk to Carol, and you're messing it up.

175
00:10:05,980 --> 00:10:08,200
本:不过,如果这样的话会更有意思.咱们来表演一下野兽怎么抓贝勒.
Ben: But wouldn't it be much more fun if we showed how, you know, the beast grabbed Belle....

176
00:10:08,200 --> 00:10:10,600
克莉丝:妈妈!
Chrissy: Mom!

177
00:10:12,940 --> 00:10:13,860
本:你去哪里?
Ben: Where are you going?

178
00:10:14,940 --> 00:10:16,880
克莉丝:上楼.你有思路了就叫我.
Chrissy: Upstairs.Call me when you get a clue.

179
00:10:19,640 --> 00:10:22,000
迈克:嘿,本,嘿,你看到埃迪了吗?
Mike: Hey, Ben.Hey, have you seen Eddie?

180
00:10:22,140 --> 00:10:25,600
本:没.嘿,也许他到操场去逗女孩了.
Ben: No.Hey, maybe he decided to go down to the playground and hog the swings.

181
00:10:27,460 --> 00:10:29,040
迈克:嘿,妈妈,你看到埃迪了吗?
Mike: Hey, mom.Have you seen Eddie?

182
00:10:29,040 --> 00:10:30,700
麦琪:你刚和他错过.大概15分钟前,他和卢克出去了.
Maggie: You just missed him.He went off with Luke about fifteen minutes ago.

183
00:10:32,980 --> 00:10:33,760
迈克:他们去哪里了?
Mike: Where'd they go?

184
00:10:33,980 --> 00:10:36,380
麦琪:他们说去食杂店买点儿东西.
Maggie: They said they were going to pick something up at the grocery store.

185
00:10:39,140 --> 00:10:40,740
迈克:你竟然让他们去了!
Mike: And you let them go!

186
00:10:50,320 --> 00:10:52,140
本:好吧,妈妈.
Ben: All right, mom.Now you gotta understand.

187
00:10:52,140 --> 00:10:54,380
现在你明白了.这个工作很辛苦,这个工作要连续的干下去.
This is very rough; it's a work in progress.

188
00:10:54,700 --> 00:10:56,640
麦琪:哦,宝贝,
Maggie: Oh, honey, I'm sure it'll be great.

189
00:10:56,880 --> 00:10:58,220
我相信你拍的棒极了.我都等不及了.
I can't wait to see what you've done.

190
00:11:00,160 --> 00:11:03,660
本:(作为播音员)请注意,开萝尔西沃.这是给你的视频邮件.
Ben (as announcer): Attention, Carol Ann Seaver.This is your video letter.

191
00:11:09,180 --> 00:11:11,220
西沃家制作,1992年.下面介绍西沃一家的活动.
Seavermania '92.The Seaver family marches on.

192
00:11:12,900 --> 00:11:16,520
星期六,爸爸又去参加精神病医学会议,
On Saturday, dad was off to yet another psychiatric convention to catch

193
00:11:16,520 --> 00:11:18,400
讨论精神病的最新治疗方法.
up on late-breaking techniques in therapy.

194
00:11:21,840 --> 00:11:24,480
在家里,克莉丝正在学整理床铺.
Back at home, Chrissy's learning to make her bed.

195
00:11:28,020 --> 00:11:30,820
妈妈和爸爸送她一只宠物,
For a reward, mom and dad got her a pet.

196
00:11:33,560 --> 00:11:38,920
克莉丝叫它"小淘气".因为不给它吃东西,
Chrissy named him "Grumpy," 'cause that's how he gets if you don't feed him.

197
00:11:43,520 --> 00:11:47,440
它就胡闹.说到吃的,前几天妈妈做了拿手菜:清蒸金枪鱼.
Speaking of food, the other day, mom made her famous tuna surprise.

198
00:11:53,520 --> 00:11:57,180
你永远的恋人德怀特霍利伯顿经常来我们家.
The love of your life, Dwight Halliburton, drops in all the time.

199
00:11:59,940 --> 00:12:02,080
不止他一个人想你,
Dwight's not the only one who's broken up;

200
00:12:02,320 --> 00:12:05,040
妈妈也想跟你说说心里话.
mom really misses her heart-to-heart talks with you.

201
00:12:10,520 --> 00:12:13,560
这段时间,卢克开始约会了,
Meanwhile, Luke almost had a date, until her mother found out.

202
00:12:17,440 --> 00:12:19,560
结果被女孩的妈妈发现了.迈克自告奋勇地抢占了的你小车,
Mike volunteered to detail your car.

203
00:12:25,940 --> 00:12:27,660
他还用烟熏了你的房间.好了,
He also fumigated your room.

204
00:12:30,480 --> 00:12:32,840
没什么别的要说的了.不过(出现在屏幕上)结束.
Well, there's nothing left to say, but (on-screen) The End.

205
00:12:40,540 --> 00:12:44,100
本:那么,你觉得怎么样,妈妈?很前卫,是不是?
Ben: So.What do you think, mom?Pretty leading-edge, huh?

206
00:12:44,940 --> 00:12:46,960
麦琪:你干得很漂亮,宝贝.
Maggie: Well, it's very clever, honey,

207
00:12:46,980 --> 00:12:50,060
不过你在家里拍的那些画面呢?
but what happened to all that stuff you shot around the house?

208
00:12:50,360 --> 00:12:51,620
本:那些不出彩.
Ben: I'd rather watch kelp.

209
00:12:53,260 --> 00:12:54,760
麦琪:不过,这是家庭的……
Maggie: But it was the family.

210
00:12:55,420 --> 00:12:56,240
本:你是什么看法?
Ben: So what's your point?

211
00:12:57,200 --> 00:12:59,000
麦琪:我觉得你应该加上那些.
Maggie: I think you should put it back in.

212
00:12:59,000 --> 00:13:00,600
本:妈妈,它应该有点风格,这是"本西沃电影制作公司出品".
Ben: Mom, it's gotta have a little style if it's gonna be "une film de Ben Seaver."

213
00:13:04,480 --> 00:13:06,760
麦琪:不,这是"给开萝尔西沃的家信".
Maggie: No, it's "une letter to Carol Seaver."

214
00:13:07,980 --> 00:13:10,320
这是她寄给我们的信.
Here's her last letter that she sent to us.

215
00:13:10,440 --> 00:13:13,380
你看看,然后决定她想看什么.
You read it, and you decide what she wants to see.

216
00:13:34,940 --> 00:13:37,860
大汉: 哇,童子军.没有口令是不准进的.
Bouncer: Whoa, boy scout.You can't come in here without a password.

217
00:13:37,980 --> 00:13:40,460
迈克:哦,没关系.我不想进去;我只是想找个人.
Mike: Oh, that's okay.I'm not trying to get in; I'm just looking for someone.

218
00:13:40,640 --> 00:13:41,820
大汉:是吗,好.我是麦考利·卡尔金,口令!
Bouncer: Yeah, right.And I'm McCauley Caulkin.Password.

219
00:13:44,500 --> 00:13:47,100
迈克:哦,哦,我知道,就在我的嘴边.
Mike: Oh, oh, well I know it.It just slipped my mind.

220
00:13:47,180 --> 00:13:48,600
口令是,呃,香蕉,纸?塑料?
It's, uh, it's uh, bananas.Paper?Plastic?

221
00:13:52,560 --> 00:13:53,380
大汉:错了.笨球儿.
Bouncer: Beat it, slimeball.

222
00:13:53,480 --> 00:13:54,500
迈克:听着,门卫先生,
Mike: Look, uh, Mr.Funt.

223
00:13:55,820 --> 00:13:58,540
这个口令怎么样?警察来巡逻,检查身份证.
How's this for a password; a squadcar full of cops checking ID's?

224
00:13:59,540 --> 00:14:00,480
大汉:这回对了,先生.
Bouncer: Right this way, sir.

225
00:14:06,840 --> 00:14:08,440
迈克:好了,卢克,跟我出去.
Mike: Okay, Luke, you're coming with me.

226
00:14:08,540 --> 00:14:10,940
卢克:你把我与其他人弄混了.我叫加拉尔多.
Luke: You got me mixed up with somebody else.My name's Jeraldo.

227
00:14:12,000 --> 00:14:13,660
梅勒妮:他不是你要找的人.
Melanie: Not the one you think.

228
00:14:13,660 --> 00:14:20,800
埃迪:迈克,这位是查丽丝,这是梅勒妮.她们是寡妇.干嘛不跟我们一起坐会儿.迈克,算了吧,别对女孩子们这么凶嘛.来吧.
Eddie: Mike, this is Charese and Melanie.They're widows.Why don't you take a seat with us, Mike.Come on, don't be rude to the girls.Come on.

229
00:14:24,820 --> 00:14:26,600
卢克:求你了,别让我难堪.
Luke: Please, don't embarrass me.

230
00:14:28,680 --> 00:14:32,220
查丽丝:听着,我有个女朋友和你正好相配.
Charese: You know, I have a friend who is just your type.(laughing) She'll

231
00:14:32,220 --> 00:14:34,020
(笑)她一会儿就跳完了,15分钟以后.
be finished dancing there in fifteen minutes.

232
00:14:37,200 --> 00:14:38,740
迈克:不,谢谢,我在找你.
Mike: No, thanks.I'm seeing someone.

233
00:14:38,740 --> 00:14:41,520
埃迪:嘿,迈克,调调情没事儿,凯特不会知道的.
Eddie: Hey, Mike, it's okay to flirt.Kate's not gonna know.

234
00:14:41,740 --> 00:14:42,360
梅勒妮:谁是凯特?
Melanie: Who's Kate?

235
00:14:42,520 --> 00:14:43,640
埃迪:哦,她是个女看守.
Eddie: Oh, she's the warden.

236
00:14:43,840 --> 00:14:45,180
卢克:她会用鞭子打人,
Luke: The one who cracks the whip.

237
00:14:47,660 --> 00:14:50,260
迈克:对不起,埃迪,我能跟你说一一句话吗?
Mike: Excuse me.Eddie, can I borrow your ear for a second?

238
00:14:50,260 --> 00:14:50,900
埃迪:当然了.
Eddie: Sure.

239
00:14:50,900 --> 00:14:53,700
迈克:我说,你把卢克带到这种地方来,是不是疯了?
Mike: Look, are you crazy for bringing Luke to a place like this?

240
00:14:57,740 --> 00:15:00,800
埃迪:嘿,这是个优雅的地方.你看谁没穿衣服呀?
Eddie: Hey, this is a classy joint.Do you see one spinning tassel?

241
00:15:00,840 --> 00:15:02,960
迈克:埃迪,这跟穿不穿衣服是两码事.
Mike: Eddie, this has nothing to do with spinning tassels.

242
00:15:03,000 --> 00:15:05,460
你不该带一个未成年人到夜总会来.
It has to do with bringing a minor into a nightclub.

243
00:15:06,640 --> 00:15:11,260
埃迪:迈克,你想给我玩保守吗?也许我们可以出去找个地方好好赌一场!
Eddie: Mike, are you turning fogey on me?I mean, maybe we can get out

244
00:15:11,260 --> 00:15:12,980
of here and go find a hot game of bingo

245
00:15:14,260 --> 00:15:18,040
然后明天,我们穿上黑袜子,
And then tomorrow we can put on our dark socks with our plaid shorts,

246
00:15:18,660 --> 00:15:21,220
配上一条花格短裤,
and drive around town at two miles an hour.

247
00:15:21,220 --> 00:15:23,280
以每小时2英里的速度开着车在城里转悠,左眼从头到尾不眨一下.
With our left blinker going the whole time.

248
00:15:24,980 --> 00:15:26,520
迈克:好,你继续笑我吧,
Mike: Fine.Now go ahead and make fun of me, Eddie.

249
00:15:26,700 --> 00:15:27,780
埃迪.
Now you may think that I'm an old fogey,

250
00:15:28,420 --> 00:15:30,380
你可以把我当成老保守,可是我觉得你要把他给带坏了.
but I think you're a bad influence on Luke.

251
00:15:31,400 --> 00:15:32,460
埃迪:嘿,谢谢,伙计.
Eddie: Hey, thanks, man.

252
00:15:32,460 --> 00:15:33,500
迈克:我是开认真的,埃迪.我不想再让你带着他闲逛.
Mike: I'm serious, Eddie.Now I don't want you hanging around with him anymore.

253
00:15:33,500 --> 00:15:34,200
埃迪:为什么?
Eddie: Why?

254
00:15:38,320 --> 00:15:41,600
迈克:因为你下流,你不负责任,
Mike: Because you're sleazy.You're irresponsible, and you're immature.

255
00:15:42,520 --> 00:15:44,380
你不成熟.事实上,我都不知道以前怎么会和你在一起的?
In fact, I don't even know why I hang out with you.

256
00:15:46,560 --> 00:15:48,560
查丽丝:来吧,艾德瓦多,去跳舞.
Charese: Come on, Eduardo, let's dance.

257
00:15:51,560 --> 00:15:53,760
卢克:我在想,该任何表达现在的心情.
Luke: I'm thinking of having my own talk show.

258
00:15:56,080 --> 00:15:58,580
迈克:对不起,加拉尔多,我能跟你说一句话吗?
Mike: Excuse me, Jeraldo.Can I borrow your ear for a second?

259
00:16:06,920 --> 00:16:08,480
麦琪:早上好,亲爱的,吃早餐吗?
Maggie: Morning, sweatheart.Want some breakfast?

260
00:16:08,680 --> 00:16:13,300
迈克:不,谢谢妈妈.我不饿.妈妈,你能回答我一个问题吗?
Mike: No thanks, mom.I'm not hungry.Mom, would you answer me one question?

261
00:16:13,640 --> 00:16:17,120
究竟是什么让你和爸爸着魔而让我和埃迪这个流氓混在一起的?
What on Earth possessed you and dad to ever let me hang out with a jerk

262
00:16:17,120 --> 00:16:17,560
like Eddie?

263
00:16:18,260 --> 00:16:19,840
我是说,我们干尽了坏事,
